Description: self-hosted lightweight software forge
 Forgejo is a self-hosted lightweight software forge: Git hosting, code
 review, issue tracking, package registries, wikis and CI (Forgejo
 Actions), with a web interface and an API. It keeps its data in SQLite,
 PostgreSQL or MySQL/MariaDB.
 .
 The service is installed but not enabled: its install wizard lets the
 first visitor configure the instance, so start it when you're ready to
 complete it (see /usr/share/doc/forgejo/README.Debian).
